      "content": "When the pain feels like it is entirely senseless, the desire for the noise to stop is a very understandable response to unbearable emotional pressure. This deep exhaustion and the desire to cease the struggle are serious signals that your distress needs immediate care. Please know that having these intense thoughts does not mean you have to act on them; reaching out to a crisis line can offer immediate support in this moment. You can connect with people who can listen without judgment right now.",
